WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.180
I am a small stone seal, over

2
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.160
four thousand years old.

3
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.710
No one alive can read me.

4
00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:10.766
I was cut from steatite, a soft

5
00:00:10.766 --> 00:00:13.546
stone, and given a hard white

6
00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:16.013
coat. Many like me were found at

7
00:00:16.013 --> 00:00:17.896
Mohenjo daro and Harappa.

8
00:00:18.855 --> 00:00:21.535
On my face, an animal, often the

9
00:00:21.535 --> 00:00:23.015
one horned beast called a

10
00:00:23.015 --> 00:00:25.615
unicorn. Above it, a line of

11
00:00:25.615 --> 00:00:28.645
signs. Probably my owner's name.

12
00:00:29.096 --> 00:00:31.036
My work was trust.

13
00:00:31.036 --> 00:00:33.876
A sack was tied with rope, wet

14
00:00:33.876 --> 00:00:36.036
clay went on the knot, and I

15
00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.806
was pressed into it.

16
00:00:38.187 --> 00:00:41.527
If my mark arrived unbroken, no

17
00:00:41.527 --> 00:00:43.387
one had opened the sack.

18
00:00:43.387 --> 00:00:45.977
And all knew who sent it.

19
00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:48.250
Seals like me were found in

20
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.770
Mesopotamia, whose texts speak

21
00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:53.810
of Meluhha, a land of seafarers.

22
00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:55.660
Possibly, my land.

23
00:00:56.096 --> 00:00:58.376
Long after, one of us reached

24
00:00:58.376 --> 00:01:00.016
Alexander Cunningham.

25
00:01:00.016 --> 00:01:02.196
He missed how old it was.

26
00:01:02.196 --> 00:01:05.186
In fairness, I am very small.

27
00:01:05.687 --> 00:01:08.047
In nineteen twenty four, John

28
00:01:08.047 --> 00:01:09.527
Marshall told the world:

29
00:01:09.527 --> 00:01:12.627
a new civilisation, as old as

30
00:01:12.627 --> 00:01:14.237
Mesopotamia's.

31
00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:17.401
Still, my signs are silent.

32
00:01:17.401 --> 00:01:19.781
Nearly four hundred of them.

33
00:01:19.781 --> 00:01:21.491
Too many for an alphabet.

34
00:01:22.726 --> 00:01:23.726
For GS1 and Prelims:

35
00:01:23.726 --> 00:01:26.986
steatite seals, used in trade,

36
00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:28.326
with a script still

37
00:01:28.326 --> 00:01:29.136
undeciphered.

38
00:01:30.435 --> 00:01:33.195
I kept a promise for strangers.

39
00:01:33.195 --> 00:01:35.625
I still keep my secret.
